; p26 - Function parameters and return.
; JadePro uses `Var:` / `Param:` / `Returns:` in 471 places. The reference
; documents Parameter, Variable, Local Formula and Return, with body
; statements introduced by a 3-digit step number.
[Function: ZzP26Add]
    Parameter : a : Number
    Parameter : b : Number
    100 : Return : ##a + ##b
